<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss version="2.0"><channel><title>Cloudflare changelogs | Spectrum</title><description>Cloudflare changelogs for Spectrum</description><link>https://developers.cloudflare.com/changelog/</link><item><title>Spectrum - Redesigned Spectrum dashboard</title><link>https://developers.cloudflare.com/changelog/post/2026-11-19-redesigned-dashboard/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://developers.cloudflare.com/changelog/post/2026-11-19-redesigned-dashboard/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;The Spectrum pages in the Cloudflare dashboard have been redesigned. Your existing applications and their settings do not change.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Spectrum Applications&lt;/strong&gt; page lists each application&apos;s type, edge port, origin, and edge IP type, with the last minute of connections, ingress, and egress. You can search the list and sort it by column.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Creating or editing an application now opens a full page instead of a modal, with settings grouped into &lt;strong&gt;Application Configuration&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Origin Configuration&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;Advanced Options&lt;/strong&gt;. To edit an application, select its hostname, or select the three dots next to it &amp;gt; &lt;strong&gt;Edit&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can now create and edit applications that use &lt;a href=&quot;https://developers.cloudflare.com/spectrum/about/static-ip/&quot;&gt;static IPs&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href=&quot;https://developers.cloudflare.com/spectrum/about/byoip/&quot;&gt;BYOIP&lt;/a&gt; addresses in the dashboard. Under &lt;strong&gt;Edge IP Type&lt;/strong&gt;, select &lt;strong&gt;Dedicated IPs&lt;/strong&gt;. Leave &lt;strong&gt;Subdomain&lt;/strong&gt; blank to create an application on the zone apex.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;New TCP and UDP applications created in the dashboard now have &lt;strong&gt;IP Access Rules&lt;/strong&gt; turned off by default, which matches the API default. To enforce IP Access rules for an application, turn on &lt;strong&gt;IP Access Rules&lt;/strong&gt; under &lt;strong&gt;Advanced Options&lt;/strong&gt;. Existing applications keep their current setting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To create your first application, refer to &lt;a href=&quot;https://developers.cloudflare.com/spectrum/get-started/&quot;&gt;Get started with Spectrum&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To share feedback on the redesigned dashboard, complete &lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/BW9RoXZpgx7B5HZC6&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;this form&lt;span class=&quot;external-link&quot;&gt; ↗︎&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><product>Spectrum</product><category>Spectrum</category></item><item><title>Spectrum, Containers, Durable Objects, Workers - Inbound TCP and gRPC for Workers and Containers now in public beta</title><link>https://developers.cloudflare.com/changelog/post/2026-11-19-inbound-tcp/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://developers.cloudflare.com/changelog/post/2026-11-19-inbound-tcp/</guid><description>
&lt;p&gt;Inbound TCP connections to Workers and bidirectional gRPC in Containers are now in public beta.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Worker-origin Spectrum applications are available on Pro and Business zones, and on Enterprise zones with Spectrum Enterprise enabled. Without Spectrum Enterprise, Pro and Business zones support one Worker-origin application per zone, on one TCP port.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;mermaid&quot;&gt;flowchart LR
    Client[TCP client] &amp;lt;--&amp;gt; Spectrum
    Spectrum &amp;lt;--&amp;gt; Worker[&quot;Worker connect()&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;Handle or forward bytes&quot;]
    Worker &amp;lt;--&amp;gt; DO[&quot;Durable Object&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;connect()&quot;]
    DO &amp;lt;--&amp;gt; Container[&quot;Container&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;gRPC or other TCP server&quot;]
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;div tabindex=&quot;-1&quot; class=&quot;heading-wrapper level-h4&quot;&gt;&lt;h4 id=&quot;forward-a-worker-socket-to-a-durable-object&quot;&gt;Forward a Worker socket to a Durable Object&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;anchor-link&quot; href=&quot;#forward-a-worker-socket-to-a-durable-object&quot;&gt;&lt;span aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;anchor-icon&quot;&gt;&lt;svg width=&quot;16&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; viewBox=&quot;0 0 24 24&quot;&gt;&lt;path fill=&quot;currentcolor&quot; d=&quot;m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42Zm8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33ZM8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 1.1.22 1 1 0 0 0 .32-.22l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42Z&quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
